{"id":"wb-3-245","name":"南唐二陵","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"南唐二陵","text":"南唐二陵位于南京市江宁区谷里街道祖堂山南麓，是五代十国时期南唐国前两位帝王的陵墓，包括南唐烈祖李昪的钦陵和中主李璟的顺陵，后主李煜死于洛阳，葬北邙山，因此在故都没有自己的陵墓。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%97%E5%94%90%E4%BA%8C%E9%99%B5","revisionId":93387696,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93387696","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/3e8de9a392fcabf5fa477792.jpg","title":"Nantang06.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nantang06.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a9/Nantang06.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"无法识别作者。根据版权声明推断作者为Px820~commonswiki。","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/","caption":"南唐二陵 順陵入口 2004年4月24日撮影 撮影者：権作\n\n参照：http://px820.onmitsu.jp/kankou/nantang/nantang01.html","width":320,"height":240}}